            "raw_output": "126:        seed: Seed for the shuffle order and the per-worker RNGs. Defaults to ``cfg.seed``.\n128:            a bare ``shuffle=True`` seeds its sampler from whatever the global torch RNG\n130:            RNG earlier in the program silently reshuffles the data.\n134:        ``(train_loader, val_loader)``. Only the training loader shuffles.\n147:        drop_last=True,\n156:    # An explicit generator makes the shuffle a function of the seed alone, rather than\n158:    shuffle_generator = torch.Generator()\n159:    shuffle_generator.manual_seed(base_seed)\n161:    train_loader = DataLoader(\n162:        train_dataset, shuffle=True, generator=shuffle_generator, **loader_kwargs\n164:    # No generator for validation: it is not shuffled, so there is nothing to seed.\n165:    val_loader = DataLoader(val_dataset, shuffle=False, **loader_kwargs)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/workshop_infrastructure/models",
